                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A synthetic delta-9-tetrahydrocannabinol that is used to control nausea caused by chemotherapy and to stimulate appetite in cases of AIDS-induced anorexia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
