                                                "sense_id": "c45f3983-ce49-3f7d-b11b-0fd869ce1961",
                                                "text": "The others, dronabinol (Marinol, Syndros) and nabilone (Cesamet), are pills used to curb nausea in cancer patients undergoing chemotherapy and to stimulate appetite in AIDS patients with wasting syndrome."
                                            }
